WEBVTT

00:00:01.081 --> 00:00:12.959
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.093 --> 00:00:18.665
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.665 --> 00:00:25.594
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.106 --> 00:00:37.142
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.317 --> 00:00:43.256
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.256 --> 00:00:50.662
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.433 --> 00:00:58.472
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.472 --> 00:01:05.345
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:10.951
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:10.951 --> 00:01:17.224
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.224 --> 00:01:25.654
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:32.105 --> 00:01:34.005
NOHEDGE, EASTERN MAINLAND

00:01:41.581 --> 00:01:43.606
Mama!

00:01:47.454 --> 00:01:49.456
Who are you?!

00:01:49.456 --> 00:01:52.926
-What are doing to my daughter?!
-P-Please wait! Let me explain...

00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:55.019
I'm calling the police!

00:02:28.929 --> 00:02:32.833
-Seashells?
-Look, Mama! Look how many!

00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:35.165
That old man gave them to me!

00:02:44.578 --> 00:02:49.413
KOKKURI ISLAND

00:03:03.363 --> 00:03:05.388
Helga?

00:03:05.532 --> 00:03:07.557
Helga!

00:03:31.758 --> 00:03:35.387
I wanted to see her
one more time.

00:03:35.929 --> 00:03:38.489
One more time...

00:03:46.172 --> 00:03:48.367
Helga!

00:03:49.242 --> 00:03:52.473
Your clothes will get wet!

00:03:53.847 --> 00:03:55.940
Helga!

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:59.018
Come on, let's get out.

00:04:00.987 --> 00:04:04.991
-Fruit?
-Hey! So you finally woke up?!

00:04:04.991 --> 00:04:06.982
Thoma!

00:04:07.527 --> 00:04:09.863
Chitto! Have a bite of this!

00:04:09.863 --> 00:04:13.099
-This place is famous for them!
-Does it taste good?

00:04:13.099 --> 00:04:15.659
I guarantee you'll love it!

00:04:17.704 --> 00:04:19.797
Want some?

00:04:22.842 --> 00:04:24.833
Okay...

00:04:37.624 --> 00:04:39.659
Hey! I'm impressed!

00:04:39.659 --> 00:04:42.228
Thoma! What is this
awful tasting thing?

00:04:42.228 --> 00:04:45.599
Pokkuri fruit. It's awful but
the taste grows on you!

00:04:45.599 --> 00:04:47.601
-It's awful!
-Now don't say that!

00:04:47.601 --> 00:04:51.059
Welcome! To my secret island,
Kokkuri Island!

00:04:51.805 --> 00:04:53.840
Pokkuri Island?

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.933
Kokkuri Island!

00:04:56.443 --> 00:04:58.912
This is your island, Thoma?

00:04:58.912 --> 00:05:00.981
Yup. Because I discovered it!

00:05:00.981 --> 00:05:03.016
Wow!

00:05:03.016 --> 00:05:05.885
The guys from the orphanage
will never find you here!

00:05:05.885 --> 00:05:08.877
Come on! I'll show you two
something really cool!

00:05:22.702 --> 00:05:27.139
Whenever we get worn out,
we always come back here.

00:05:28.808 --> 00:05:30.810
Tarlant.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.801
Yeah.

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:36.883
Since Serafine's death 111 years ago...

00:05:36.883 --> 00:05:39.215
...all signs of Tina have vanished.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:44.218
How many nights have gone by?

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.259
CLAIRMONT SANATORIUM & HOSPITAL

00:05:56.369 --> 00:06:00.940
This is the passage
of 111 years...

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.500
This is the judgment of the universe.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:09.947
Time calmly changes people and things,
amidst activity and silence.

00:06:10.483 --> 00:06:14.044
Though we don't change at all.

00:06:18.258 --> 00:06:20.593
I collected all of this myself!

00:06:20.593 --> 00:06:22.595
A television!

00:06:22.595 --> 00:06:26.166
Oh, that doesn't work. There's
no electricity and it's broken.

00:06:26.166 --> 00:06:28.157
Ugh, come on!

00:06:29.502 --> 00:06:31.504
What are you doing?!

00:06:31.504 --> 00:06:34.940
My fault! Sorry!
Anyway, look at this!

00:06:35.175 --> 00:06:38.178
Ba-da-ba-da-ba-da-ba-da...

00:06:38.178 --> 00:06:41.079
Ta-da!

00:06:41.614 --> 00:06:43.616
Hiss! Hiss!

00:06:43.616 --> 00:06:47.620
That's amazing! A snake skin!
And it's huge!

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.656
Yeah! Great, isn't it?!

00:06:49.656 --> 00:06:52.523
I wish I could show you
the real thing, Chitto!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.126
It's on this island?!

00:06:58.164 --> 00:07:00.800
Don't be disappointed! I show it to you
up close some time!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.335
Y-Yeah.

00:07:02.335 --> 00:07:04.370
Huh? What's that?!

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:06.361
So you noticed!

00:07:11.144 --> 00:07:13.374
Watch closely, Chitto!

00:07:19.652 --> 00:07:22.122
Try not to faint
from shock!

00:07:22.122 --> 00:07:24.113
W-What?!

00:07:27.794 --> 00:07:29.785
Okay!

00:07:32.599 --> 00:07:34.590
What d'ya think?!

00:07:35.101 --> 00:07:38.867
This is the fighting style
taught on Papin Island!

00:07:39.572 --> 00:07:41.563
Thoma!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.641
-Ouch! Ow, ow, ow...
-Are you okay?

00:07:48.114 --> 00:07:50.344
I'm used to it.

00:07:53.586 --> 00:07:56.089
That's right! I've got something
you're going to love, Chitto!

00:07:56.089 --> 00:07:59.252
-I will?!!
-Yeah, you're really gonna laugh!

00:08:02.162 --> 00:08:04.153
Helga?

00:08:06.866 --> 00:08:09.536
I know it's around here somewhere...

00:08:09.536 --> 00:08:12.472
Here it is!
Look! This is it!

00:08:12.472 --> 00:08:16.465
It's my Mr. Bora Bora!
Huh?

00:08:40.466 --> 00:08:42.468
You know, usually...

00:08:42.468 --> 00:08:46.165
Usually people say "thank you"
when someone helps them!

00:08:46.873 --> 00:08:51.537
I-I'm sorry, Thoma.
Thank you for helping us.

00:08:59.352 --> 00:09:01.684
I'm going to get
some food!

00:09:11.831 --> 00:09:14.834
Here. This should do
for today!

00:09:14.834 --> 00:09:18.270
My mom will notice if
I take too much at once.

00:09:18.471 --> 00:09:20.807
This one and... this one.

00:09:20.807 --> 00:09:22.809
-Thoma!
-What?!

00:09:22.809 --> 00:09:25.511
There's only vegetables
and rice in here.

00:09:25.511 --> 00:09:28.503
There's a lot of fruit
on this island.

00:09:35.455 --> 00:09:38.253
Chitto! Go in back
and start a fire.

00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:42.061
The pot... the pot...
Found it!

00:09:48.234 --> 00:09:50.570
Is that girl always like that?

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:52.834
Don't call her "that girl"!

00:09:53.006 --> 00:09:56.339
Don't you dare
call Helga "that" anything!

00:10:05.885 --> 00:10:08.288
Ooh! My back hurts!

00:10:08.288 --> 00:10:10.620
I'm taking
a little break!

00:10:26.773 --> 00:10:28.764
Geez!

00:10:38.918 --> 00:10:42.513
It's fine, Helga.
I'll do it.

00:10:48.728 --> 00:10:50.719
Good!

00:10:54.133 --> 00:10:56.499
We're all out.

00:10:59.272 --> 00:11:01.274
Here!

00:11:01.274 --> 00:11:04.266
Here, go and get
some water!

00:11:05.578 --> 00:11:07.580
I can go
get the water.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:11.277
You already have stuff to do,
Chitto. It's right over there.

00:11:11.384 --> 00:11:13.953
If you go through that forest
you'll find a stream.

00:11:13.953 --> 00:11:16.622
-Do you think she'll be okay?
-Now, listen!

00:11:16.622 --> 00:11:19.284
There's only so much you
can take care of someone!

00:11:27.166 --> 00:11:30.158
Helga's taking a long time.

00:11:31.471 --> 00:11:35.771
I wonder what's wrong.
Maybe she fell into the stream!

00:11:36.275 --> 00:11:38.378
It's not deep enough
to drown in!

00:11:38.378 --> 00:11:40.369
Yeah, but...

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.977
-I'm gonna go look!
-H-Hey!

00:11:45.852 --> 00:11:47.717
Geez!

00:11:49.956 --> 00:11:54.290
I wanted to see her
one more time.

00:11:57.063 --> 00:11:59.098
Wah! Thoma!

00:11:59.098 --> 00:12:01.100
What the heck?

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.091
Helga!

00:12:09.609 --> 00:12:11.702
Where's the water?!

00:12:11.978 --> 00:12:14.003
I'm sorry.

00:12:18.951 --> 00:12:21.943
That's why I said
I'd go get the water.

00:12:23.156 --> 00:12:27.115
Oh, geez!

00:12:38.004 --> 00:12:41.269
NOHEDGE POLICE HEADQUARTERS

00:12:43.676 --> 00:12:45.803
What do you think it is?

00:12:46.913 --> 00:12:49.615
Ah, Cooks! Have you heard
what's been going on?

00:12:49.615 --> 00:12:53.949
A man named "Grass" who's supposed
to be dead has suddenly come back?

00:12:54.053 --> 00:12:56.385
Well, about that...

00:12:56.856 --> 00:12:58.847
An old man?

00:12:59.258 --> 00:13:02.395
This is a video from when he was
brought in a little while ago.

00:13:02.395 --> 00:13:04.730
Grass is actually someone
I know pretty well.

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:08.928
3 years ago, he passed
away at the age of 31.

00:13:09.635 --> 00:13:11.737
So this old man was lying?

00:13:11.737 --> 00:13:14.207
He certainly doesn't look
like he's in his thirties.

00:13:14.207 --> 00:13:17.301
And when we went to question him,
we realized he had died.

00:13:25.852 --> 00:13:27.877
What is that?!

00:13:29.755 --> 00:13:32.417
That's Grass's late mother.

00:13:32.792 --> 00:13:35.928
Actually, I saw her
this morning, too.

00:13:35.928 --> 00:13:38.920
But I thought I must have
been imagining things.

00:13:39.265 --> 00:13:41.927
And then there's this.

00:13:44.904 --> 00:13:47.507
Apparently, Grass promised
to get his daughter...

00:13:47.507 --> 00:13:50.567
...some seashells before
he left for work.

00:13:50.676 --> 00:13:53.412
-He promised?
-There's no way...

00:13:53.412 --> 00:13:56.415
...that old man could have
known such a personal detail.

00:13:56.415 --> 00:13:59.619
I don't know.
We've been investigating but...

00:13:59.619 --> 00:14:03.419
Even after questioning our men,
they all say no one was there.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:07.352
-Please stop the video!
-Sure.

00:14:15.101 --> 00:14:17.770
-What's wrong?
-Uh, nothing.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:21.433
In that case, why don't you
autopsy the body to identify it?

00:14:21.474 --> 00:14:24.466
We would have already
done that if we could.

00:14:24.577 --> 00:14:26.145
But just before you got here,

00:14:26.145 --> 00:14:28.814
people claiming to be
federal secret service agents...

00:14:28.814 --> 00:14:32.051
...forcibly took the body
without any explanations.

00:14:32.051 --> 00:14:35.688
-What did you say?!
-I was hoping you could help us but...

00:14:35.688 --> 00:14:37.690
Sorry about this.

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:41.023
By the way, are you making
any progress on Flo's case?

00:14:41.894 --> 00:14:43.885
Excuse me!

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.633
-Are you Detective Cooks?
-Yes, I am. And you are?

00:14:47.633 --> 00:14:50.469
I'm Alice. Alice Holingworth.

00:14:50.469 --> 00:14:53.873
I'm an examiner from the Federal
Law Enforcement Agency head office,

00:14:53.873 --> 00:14:55.898
Internal Affairs division.

00:14:57.109 --> 00:14:59.202
Oh, brother.

00:15:01.047 --> 00:15:04.380
You've been staying at this hotel
for the past 6 years, correct?

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:08.183
I only come back to sleep.
The room's pretty messy.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.821
Who are you?!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.003
-Is this all you have?
-What?!

00:15:24.003 --> 00:15:27.907
After all this time,
this is all you've found?

00:15:27.907 --> 00:15:31.570
What are you talking about?! Do you
know who those children are?!

00:15:32.812 --> 00:15:36.873
They're evil, loathsome monsters.

00:15:38.751 --> 00:15:40.742
Don't move!

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.385
Blast!

00:15:49.795 --> 00:15:51.820
Who was that?

00:15:52.498 --> 00:15:54.591
Was anything stolen?

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.360
There's nothing worth
stealing in here.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.873
Just what exactly are
you investigating?

00:16:00.873 --> 00:16:05.578
I was told that six years ago you
were sent out here by the main office...

00:16:05.578 --> 00:16:08.911
...to investigate the disappearance
of a girl from Nohedge.

00:16:09.115 --> 00:16:13.017
This is six years worth of material
I've collected since coming out here.

00:16:13.519 --> 00:16:17.148
That's a picture of the girl
who went missing, Flo.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:23.095
And these are boys who also disappeared
six years ago and are still missing.

00:16:23.095 --> 00:16:26.465
Lan from Sanceli Island,
Thomas from Wattfort,

00:16:26.465 --> 00:16:30.902
Teo from Otorad
and Kalie from West Silies.

00:16:31.103 --> 00:16:36.175
I guess I'm not the only one interested
in where these children have gone.

00:16:36.175 --> 00:16:38.609
There was more than
one disappearance?

00:16:46.619 --> 00:16:51.386
What is this?
The Children of Befort?

00:16:52.958 --> 00:16:56.395
That picture was taken by
my grandfather, a journalist.

00:16:56.395 --> 00:16:58.488
Don't they look alike?

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:04.759
They do look a little different from
when they were five years old.

00:17:05.371 --> 00:17:10.309
But this picture, it's from 1901.
More than 100 years ago.

00:17:10.309 --> 00:17:12.912
Their eyes, the shape of their chins,
their attitudes...

00:17:12.912 --> 00:17:15.472
...are all very similar to
this picture here.

00:17:15.581 --> 00:17:18.617
If it was a color picture, we might
have been able to confirm that

00:17:18.617 --> 00:17:21.120
...their white hair and eye color
were the same as well.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.122
What are you saying?

00:17:23.122 --> 00:17:26.025
Are you suggesting these children
have been alive for over 100 years?

00:17:26.025 --> 00:17:31.497
Unfortunately, all the children in that
picture passed away in the year 1901.

00:17:31.497 --> 00:17:35.368
All on the same day, at the same time,
when they were eleven years old.

00:17:35.368 --> 00:17:37.002
The same day?

00:17:37.002 --> 00:17:39.772
Right after my grandfather
took that picture.

00:17:39.772 --> 00:17:44.210
It seems the bodies were then identified
and sent back to their homes.

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:47.012
This journal was left behind by
a scholar named Radcliffe...

00:17:47.012 --> 00:17:49.776
...who investigated those children.

00:17:50.015 --> 00:17:52.347
Though it's a bit erratic.

00:17:52.551 --> 00:17:55.154
This is a voice recording
from 100 years ago.

00:17:55.154 --> 00:17:58.590
-Radcliffe's voice is on it.
-What?

00:18:03.362 --> 00:18:06.031
-It's done.
-Thank you.

00:18:06.031 --> 00:18:08.363
Is this about that case from earlier?

00:18:09.635 --> 00:18:13.339
This is the demon god from
this country's old myths. "Ged," right?

00:18:13.339 --> 00:18:15.207
What is that?

00:18:15.207 --> 00:18:19.645
A long time ago there was a federal
science agency called the "Ged Group."

00:18:19.645 --> 00:18:22.982
A research organization
that was studying a certain stone.

00:18:22.982 --> 00:18:25.177
A stone?

00:18:25.317 --> 00:18:29.522
111 years ago,
in the year 1901...

00:18:29.522 --> 00:18:32.591
My grandfather found a
strange piece of black rock...

00:18:32.591 --> 00:18:37.096
...next to the bodies of the Children
of Befort, where they died in Clairmont.

00:18:37.096 --> 00:18:41.123
Radcliffe was the first scholar
to research it.

00:18:42.067 --> 00:18:43.569
That old man who just died...

00:18:43.569 --> 00:18:47.596
...had the same symbol as
that group on his clothing.

00:18:48.107 --> 00:18:50.109
I just can't help wondering.

00:18:50.109 --> 00:18:53.879
You're saying that this 100 year old
group is still active today?

00:18:53.879 --> 00:18:57.283
That's hard to believe.
Listen, Detective Cooks...

00:18:57.283 --> 00:18:59.518
I was sent here by the head office...

00:18:59.518 --> 00:19:02.688
...because you haven't sent in
a report for more than year.

00:19:02.688 --> 00:19:06.258
In addition, your continuing disregard
for repeated orders...

00:19:06.258 --> 00:19:08.561
...is clearly against regulations.

00:19:08.561 --> 00:19:12.258
Depending on the report I
submit on you, Detective Cooks...

00:19:12.565 --> 00:19:14.897
You could face severe punishment.

00:19:16.235 --> 00:19:18.504
That's right, you said
your name's Alice, right?

00:19:18.504 --> 00:19:21.173
That's a nice name,
full of curiosity.

00:19:21.173 --> 00:19:23.909
What are you talking about?
You're being creepy.

00:19:23.909 --> 00:19:26.078
And it's good that
you're strong-willed.

00:19:26.078 --> 00:19:27.613
As an able inspector
with the head office,

00:19:27.613 --> 00:19:30.082
could you possibly be a little flexible?

00:19:30.082 --> 00:19:34.041
There's something I'd
like you to check out for me.

00:20:15.361 --> 00:20:17.556
I got some wood!

00:20:23.669 --> 00:20:26.001
You have to eat something.

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:30.676
That's right! I'll go
get you some fruit!

00:20:30.676 --> 00:20:34.578
There might be some tasty
ones like Thoma said!

00:20:48.294 --> 00:20:51.889
Is that all you've got?
It won't last the night.

00:20:56.569 --> 00:20:59.629
Chitto! Chitto!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:03.800
Where did he
run off to?

00:21:09.915 --> 00:21:12.179
Hold it! Hold it!

00:21:16.622 --> 00:21:19.955
Geez! Chitto!

00:21:20.192 --> 00:21:23.457
That Chitto! Where'd he go?

00:21:27.399 --> 00:21:30.102
Hey! Where's Chitto?

00:21:30.102 --> 00:21:32.137
Chitto hasn't come back yet.

00:21:32.137 --> 00:21:34.340
Did he say where he was going?

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:38.210
Chitto? Chitto!

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:41.046
You didn't notice he's gone?!
Guess there's no choice.

00:21:41.046 --> 00:21:44.243
I'm going to take a look around,
you just stay here!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.286
Don't move!
Don't move!

00:21:47.286 --> 00:21:49.955
Stay here!
The rain is getting harder,

00:21:49.955 --> 00:21:53.755
and it's already dark in the woods!
Even if you come, you won't be any help!

00:21:54.893 --> 00:21:56.986
Don't follow me!

00:22:00.432 --> 00:22:04.493
You're not going to be any
help even if you do come!

00:22:36.568 --> 00:22:46.375
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:46.712 --> 00:22:56.255
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:56.255 --> 00:23:00.988
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:06.095
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:06.331 --> 00:23:15.467
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:15.808 --> 00:23:20.879
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:20.879 --> 00:23:25.851
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.851 --> 00:23:30.254
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:30.589 --> 00:23:34.893
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

